nd more agile, they are dangerous creatures that snatch prey from hunters.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Can land on deployable high ground, where its attacks become ranged and deal Arts damage","Increases Avalanche Warning Index when landing in an Avalanche Area","Takes off again after some time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":300,"def":150,"res":15,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"snowbrat":{"slug":"snowbrat","name":"Snowbrat","icon":"/enemies-icons/Snowbrat.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Taller and more solidly built than other Snowchildren, they have become even more hyperactive due to the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan. Most have completed the achievement of going all the way around Kjerag.","abilities":["Takes extra damage on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":300,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"frostcradler_fowlbeast":{"slug":"frostcradler_fowlbeast","name":"Frostcradler Fowlbeast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Frostcradler Fowlbeast.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Fowlbeasts indigenous to Kjerag. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan has strengthened their vision and sense of smell, but also made them more aggressive. They clutch an icy rock formed from an unhatched egg, which they use to dig for food and crack the skulls of enemies.","abilities":["Loses egg after being shifted, gaining Movement Speed and becoming unblockable"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":400,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"penumbral_snowball":{"slug":"penumbral_snowball","name":"Penumbral Snowball","icon":"/enemies-icons/Penumbral Snowball.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Creatures indigenous to Kjerag. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan seems to have changed their friendly nature, and made their fur even softer and fluffier, providing excellent protection against the cold.","abilities":["Absorbs passing Snowbrats to increase its weight, HP, ATK, DEF, and RES","Returns to initial form on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":300,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"blackhorn_rhuul":{"slug":"blackhorn_rhuul","name":"Blackhorn Rhuul","icon":"/enemies-icons/Blackhorn Rhuul.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Sturdy burdenbeasts with massive horns on their heads. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan has turned their horns black. The Saintess said: Once upon a time, there was a girl who, finding the sight of others accompanied by their pets endearing, wanted a pet of her own. She thought she should first give it a name...","abilities":["[Clash of Brawn] Performs Charged Attacks and tries to push units that block it","After charging, deals damage to the target and pushes it back one tile; if unable to push, deals more damage and stuns the target for several seconds","Charge can be interrupted by negative statuses like Stun and Shift"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1000,"def":800,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"karlan_saintess":{"slug":"karlan_saintess","name":"Karlan Saintess","icon":"/enemies-icons/Karlan Saintess.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The chosen one. She rings her bell, again and again, for you, and for Her.","abilities":["Revives when defeated","First Phase","[Pious Prayer] Prays at specific locations, dealing damage to and paralyzing the <Maiden of Snow and Ice> when prayer is complete","Prayer can be interrupted by negative statuses like Stun and Shift","Ritual enters the second phase when all prayer steps are complete","Phase 2","[Heart of Breakthrough] Periodically attacks, breaking the protection of <Kjeragandr> and allowing the <Maiden of Snow and Ice> to be attacked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":1000,"def":250,"res":15,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"kjeragandr":{"slug":"kjeragandr","name":"Kjeragandr","icon":"/enemies-icons/Kjeragandr.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"As white, as beautiful, as vast as the great icefields, She is mesmerizing and magnificent, beyond reckoning then, now, and forever.","abilities":["Periodically gives <Maiden of Snow and Ice> protection, preventing her from being attacked","Attacks together with <Maiden of Snow and Ice>, dealing Arts damage to units in an entire row and inflicting Cold","Partners with <Maiden of Snow and Ice> to unleash [Rimechill] and [Wintertide], boosting skill effects","[Silent Whiteout] Deals heavy Arts damage to all units on the field and inflicts Cold, shared by all allied units; Cold duration increases with each cast; can be cast when not on the field"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.1,"stats":{"hp":150000,"atk":750,"def":750,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":7}},"maiden_of_snow_and_ice":{"slug":"maiden_of_snow_and_ice","name":"Maiden of Snow and Ice","icon":"/enemies-icons/Maiden of Snow and Ice.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The eons and the frost both weigh upon her. Beneath her silent visage, you see the complexity of her regard, regret, relief, and resolve.","abilities":["Can perform long-ranged attacks that inflict Cold","Periodically gains increased ATK and DEF","After a long time has passed, deals Arts splash damage to all allied units on the field, and drains all Life Points","[Rimechill] Stops attacking, summoning several <'Coldness'> to lock on to the location of the <Karlan Saintess> and release there; the number of <'Coldness'> increases with each cast","<'Coldness'> takes shape after some time and flies towards the target; if not destroyed before it reaches the target, deals Arts damage in a large area and increases Avalanche Warning Index in the area","When <Kjeragandr> is on the field, also summons an equivalent number of <'Coldness'> and releases them at a targeted Operator","First Phase","Cannot be attacked; can only be damaged by [Pious Prayer] from the <Karlan Saintess>","Phase 2","[Wintertide] Stops attacking whenever HP drops by a certain percentage, summoning <Saintess' Snowrobe> to imprison the <Karlan Saintess>; during this time, <Kjeragandr> will continuously summon icicles to attack allied units, increasing the Avalanche Warning Index of areas where the icicles land","<Saintess' Snowrobe> continuously loses HP, releasing the <Karlan Saintess> when destroyed, allowing her to move again"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.1,"stats":{"hp":150000,"atk":750,"def":750,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":7}},"storisbit":{"slug":"storisbit","name":"Storisbit","icon":"/enemies-icons/Storisbit.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["